      "content": "it's not just about them being disappointed though. it's the shame. i look at them and i just see everything they gave up, and then i look at myself and i see nothing. i feel like if i just wasn't here, the mistake wouldn't exist anymore. like i'm just a way for their struggle to turn into something nothing. i just want the weight to stop. i want to stop being the person who failed them.",
